vo kortelės","Pounds (lb)":"Svarai (lb)","Privacy":"Privatumas","Progress":"Pažanga","Questions?":"Klausimų?","REPS":"PAK.","REST":"POILSIS","Ready to train?":"Pasiruošęs treniruotei?","Records":"Rekordai","Reminders":"Priminimai","Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.":"Priminimai ir poilsio laikmatis suplanuojami tavo įrenginyje. Push serverio nėra.","Reminders are planned on this device. A day you already trained (also on Apple Watch or iPad) is skipped.":"Priminimai planuojami šiame įrenginyje. Diena, kai jau sportavai (taip pat su Apple Watch ar iPad), praleidžiama.","Remove exercise":"Pašalinti pratimą","Remove favourite":"Pašalinti iš mėgstamiausių","Rest":"Poilsis","Rest is over":"Poilsis baigėsi","Rest time":"Poilsio laikas","Resting heart rate":"Ramybės pulsas","Restore":"Atkurti","Resume":"Tęsti","Routines":"Programos","SET":"SERIJA","START":"PRADĖTI","Save":"Išsaugoti","Save weight and body fat":"Išsaugoti svorį ir riebalų procentą","Save workouts":"Išsaugoti treniruotes","Saved in Apple Health":"Išsaugota Sveikatoje","Saved on this device only":"Išsaugota tik šiame įrenginyje","Scan the card or key fob, or take a screenshot of the code in your gym's app and choose it here.":"Nuskenuok kortelę ar raktų pakabuką arba padaryk kodo ekrano kopiją sporto klubo programėlėje ir pasirink ją čia.","Scan with camera":"Nuskenuoti kamera","Screen brightness is turned up":"Ekrano ryškumas padidintas","Search":"Ieškoti","Search exercise":"Ieškoti pratimo","Search gym":"Ieškoti sporto klubo","See your progress":"Matyk savo pažangą","Sessions":"Kartai","Set done":"Serija atlikta","Set {1} of {2}":"Serija {1} iš {2}","Sets":"Serijos","Sets you didn't fill in are left out.":"Neužpildytos serijos nebus įtrauktos.","Settings":"Nustatymai","Shoulders":"Pečiai","Show archived":"Rodyti archyvuotus","Show code":"Rodyti kodą","Show front":"Rodyti priekinę pusę","Show the QR code or barcode at the entrance, right from Liftr.":"Parodyk Q